 "notes": [
  "the want is load-bearing: a field consumer refuses a frame edge and a frame consumer refuses a field edge; the matched pair binds",
  "spelling the sample format in Form.pix closes the collision nodes.Step refused a field edge over \u2014 grade() is None both ways and the two Form.key()s differ",
  "reach composes across a chain: the head sits at listed[31], not listed[30]",
  "a consumer at lags (30, 20, 10) asks for each upstream field 3.56 times; holding them costs 31 fields (26.1 MB at 462x456 float32) and releases on the declaration",
  "extrapolated by pixel count, not measured: the same 31 fields at 5312x2988 float32 would be 1.97 GB",
  "recomputed p50 9.79 ms/row vs held 3.74 ms/row \u2014 2.62x, frames resident in both",
  "the consumer's own arithmetic is 0.50 ms/row and the hold cannot touch it: of the 9.28 ms/row the producer costs, holding removes 6.04 \u2014 which is why 3.56x reuse buys 2.62x wall time",
  "want, form separation, composed reach and cache equivalence all held"
